msgid "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"
msgstr "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"

#. Description of the plugin
#: npcink-abilities-toolkit.php
msgid ""
"Standalone WordPress Abilities API package toolkit for safely exposing "
"agent-callable abilities."
msgstr ""
"Boîte à outils autonome de package pour l’API Abilities de WordPress, "
"permettant d’exposer en toute sécurité des capacités appelables par des "
"agents."

#. Author of the plugin
#: npcink-abilities-toolkit.php
msgid "Npcink"
msgstr "Npcink"

#: includes/Admin/Health_Notices.php:69
msgid ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit is active, but the WordPress Abilities API "
"registration functions are unavailable. Update WordPress to 6.9 or later, or"
" enable the WordPress Abilities API baseline, before AI clients can discover"
" this site's abilities."
msgstr ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit est actif, mais les fonctions d’enregistrement de "
"l’API Abilities de WordPress sont indisponibles. Mettez à jour WordPress en "
"version 6.9 ou ultérieure, ou activez le socle de l’API Abilities de "
"WordPress, avant que les clients IA puissent découvrir les capacités de ce "
"site."

#: includes/Admin/Health_Notices.php:76
