"permalink."
msgstr ""
"Résout un URL ou un slug en un identifiant de publication, un type de "
"publication, un statut, un lien de modification et un lien permanent."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Core_WordPress_Read_Definitions.php:768
msgid "Get Post Blocks"
msgstr "Obtenez des blocs de publication"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Core_WordPress_Read_Definitions.php:769
msgid "Returns a Gutenberg block structure snapshot for a post or revision."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie un instantané de la structure de bloc Gutenberg pour une publication"
" ou une révision."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Core_WordPress_Read_Definitions.php:802
msgid "List Post Revisions"
msgstr "Répertorier les révisions des publications"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Core_WordPress_Read_Definitions.php:803
msgid "Returns a paginated read-only revision history for a post."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie un historique des révisions paginé en lecture seule pour une "
"publication."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:29
msgid "List Media"
msgstr "Liste des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:30
msgid "Returns a paginated list of media library attachments."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie une liste paginée des pièces jointes de la bibliothèque multimédia."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:75
msgid "Resolve Media Attachment By URL"
msgstr "Résoudre la pièce jointe multimédia avant URL"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:76
msgid ""
"Resolves a same-site uploads URL to bounded media attachment candidates with"
" read-only match evidence."
msgstr ""
"Résout les téléchargements URL sur le même site vers des candidats de pièce "
"jointe multimédia délimités avec une preuve de correspondance en lecture "
"seule."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:123
msgid "Build Inline Image Blocks"
msgstr "Créer des blocs d'images en ligne"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:124
msgid ""
"Converts uploaded inline image rows into append-ready Gutenberg image blocks"
" without writing post content."
msgstr ""
"Convertit les lignes d'images en ligne téléchargées en blocs d'images "
"Gutenberg prêts à être ajoutés sans écrire de contenu de publication."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:159
msgid "Build Media SEO Assets"
msgstr "Créer des éléments multimédias SEO"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:160
msgid ""
"Builds a canonical media SEO enrichment asset list from article media "
"workflow upload outputs."
msgstr ""
"Crée une liste d'actifs d'enrichissement multimédia canonique SEO à partir "
"dessorties de téléchargement du flux de travail multimédia d'article."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:192
msgid "Optimize Media Metadata"
msgstr "Optimiser les métadonnées multimédias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:193
msgid ""
"Builds deterministic media title, alt, caption, description, source, and "
"disclosure suggestions from article and media context."
msgstr ""
"Crée des suggestions déterministes de titre, d'alt, de légende, de "
"description, de source et de divulgation à partir du contexte de l'article "
"et du média."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:226
msgid "Position Inline Image Blocks"
msgstr "Positionner les blocs d'images en ligne"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:227
msgid ""
"Places generated inline image blocks after matching paragraph, heading, or "
"anchor targets and falls back to append."
msgstr ""
"Place les blocs d'images en ligne générés après avoir fait correspondre les "
"cibles de paragraphe, de titre ou d'ancrage et revient à l'ajout."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:262
msgid "Get Media Cleanup Opportunities"
msgstr "Obtenez des opportunités de nettoyage des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:263
msgid ""
"Scans a bounded media inventory and returns cleanup opportunities for "
"metadata gaps, source gaps, and likely unused assets."
msgstr ""
"Analyse un inventaire multimédia limité et renvoie des opportunités de "
"nettoyage pour les lacunes dans les métadonnées, les lacunes dans les "
"sources et les ressources probablement inutilisées."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:292
msgid "List Media Backups"
msgstr "Répertorier les sauvegardes multimédias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:293
msgid ""
"Lists recorded backup files for one attachment media operation history "
"without mutating media."
msgstr ""
"Répertorie les fichiers de sauvegarde enregistrés pour l'historique des "
"opérations d'un support de pièce jointe sans mutation du support."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:322
msgid "Build Media Inventory Fix Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan de correctif pour l'inventaire des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:323
msgid ""
"Maps bounded media inventory issues to reviewable metadata and cleanup "
"actions that reuse existing governed write abilities without mutating media."
msgstr ""
"Mappe les problèmes d’inventaire des médias limités aux métadonnées "
"consultables et aux actions de nettoyage qui réutilisent les capacités "
"d’écriture gouvernées existantes sans muter les médias."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:362
msgid "Build Media Reference Repair Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan de réparation de référence multimédia"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:363
msgid ""
"Scans post content for hard-coded URLs to a previously replaced media file "
"and builds governed patch-post-content actions without mutating posts."
msgstr ""
"Analyse le contenu de la publication à la recherche de URL codés en dur dans"
" un fichier multimédia précédemment remplacé et crée des actions de patch-"
"post-contenu régies sans muter les publications."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:398
msgid "Build Media Adoption Enhancement Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan d’amélioration d’adoption de média"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:399
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only batch plan that imports a reviewed remote image, "
"generates an optimized derivative, and optionally patches one post from an "
"old media URL to the optimized derivative."
msgstr ""
"Construit un plan de lot en lecture seule qui importe une image distante "
"examinée, génère un dérivé optimisé et, en option, corrige une publication "
"pour remplacer une ancienne URL média par le dérivé optimisé."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:446
msgid "Build Image Candidate Adoption Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan d’adoption de candidat image"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:447
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only batch plan for importing one reviewed image candidate, "
"applying reviewed media metadata, and optionally setting it as a post "
"featured image."
msgstr ""
"Construit un plan de lot en lecture seule pour importer un candidat image "
"examiné, appliquer des métadonnées média examinées et, en option, le définir"
" comme image mise en avant d’une publication."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:495
msgid "Build Image Candidate Review Artifact"
msgstr "Créer un artefact d’examen de candidat image"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:496
msgid ""
"Normalizes already retrieved image_candidate.v1 rows into a review-only "
"artifact and lightweight recommendation projections without searching, "
"generating, importing, or writing media."
msgstr ""
"Normalise des lignes image_candidate.v1 déjà récupérées en un artefact "
"réservé à l’examen et en projections de recommandations légères, sans "
"rechercher, générer, importer ni écrire de médias."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:530
msgid "Build Media ALT/Caption Review Set"
msgstr "Créer un ensemble d’examen ALT/légende de média"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:531
msgid ""
"Builds a deterministic review-only media ALT and caption candidate set from "
"supplied media metadata and optional reviewed image-context evidence without"
" inspecting pixels or writing media."
msgstr ""
"Construit de manière déterministe un ensemble de candidats ALT et légende de"
" média réservé à l’examen, à partir de métadonnées média fournies et "
"d’éléments de contexte d’image examinés facultatifs, sans inspecter les "
"pixels ni écrire de médias."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:596
msgid "Build Media ALT Apply Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan d’application ALT de média"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:597
msgid ""
"Builds one governed missing-ALT apply plan from an operator-reviewed image "
"without approving, executing, or writing media."
msgstr ""
"Construit un plan d’application gouverné pour ALT manquant à partir d’une "
"image examinée par un opérateur, sans approuver, exécuter ni écrire de "
"médias."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:631
msgid "Build Media Settings Reference Repair Plan"
msgstr ""
"Plan de réparation de référence des paramètres de support de construction"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:632
msgid ""
"Scans selected WordPress options and theme mods for hard-coded URLs to a "
"previously replaced media file and builds governed exact replacement actions"
" without mutating settings."
msgstr ""
"Analyse les options WordPress et les mods de thème sélectionnés pour les URL"
" codés en dur dans un fichier multimédia précédemment remplacé et crée des "
"actions de remplacement exactes régies sans modifier les paramètres."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:675
msgid "Get Media Inventory Health"
msgstr "Obtenez la santé de votre inventaire multimédia"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:676
msgid ""
"Scans a bounded media inventory and summarizes missing alt text, captions, "
"descriptions, source metadata, and format attention."
msgstr ""
"Analyse un inventaire multimédia limité et résume le texte alternatif, les "
"légendes, les descriptions, les métadonnées sources et l'attention au format"
" manquants."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:726
msgid "Inspect Media Asset"
msgstr "Inspecter les ressources multimédias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:727
msgid ""
"Inspects one attachment file and returns read-only format, size, dimension, "
"and optimization recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Inspecte un fichier de pièce jointe et renvoie des recommandations en "
"lecture seule sur le format, la taille, les dimensions et l'optimisation."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:780
msgid "Build Media Derivative Cloud Request"
msgstr "Créer une demande de cloud dérivé multimédia"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:781
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only request contract for a host or Cloud addon to generate an"
" optimized media derivative without uploading, calling Cloud, or mutating "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Crée un contrat de requête en lecture seule pour un hôte ou un Cloud Addon "
"afin de générer un dérivé multimédia optimisé sans télécharger, appeler "
"Cloud ou muter WordPress."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:857
msgid "Build Media Optimization Plan"
msgstr "Élaborer un plan d'optimisation des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:858
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only one-attachment optimization plan that combines reviewed "
"media metadata updates with a governed derivative adoption action for one "
"Core approval."
msgstr ""
"Crée un plan d'optimisation en lecture seule à une pièce jointe qui combine "
"les mises à jour des métadonnées multimédias examinées avec une action "
"d'adoption dérivée gouvernée pour une approbation Core."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:912
msgid "Build Media Adoption Preflight Summary"
msgstr "Créer un résumé de contrôle en amont d’adoption de média"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:913
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only preflight summary for adopting one reviewed media "
"derivative artifact, including current asset evidence, derivative "
"comparison, bounded content-reference impact, and next-step guidance without"
" mutating WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Construit un résumé de contrôle en amont en lecture seule pour adopter un "
"artefact de dérivé média examiné, incluant les preuves sur l’élément actuel,"
" la comparaison du dérivé, l’impact borné sur les références de contenu et "
"des conseils pour les étapes suivantes, sans modifier WordPress."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:962
msgid "Build Media Rename Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan de renommage des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:963
msgid ""
"Builds a read-only one-attachment rename plan for a reviewed target media "
"file name and exact post-content reference updates without mutating "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Crée un plan de renommage d'une pièce jointe en lecture seule pour un nom de"
" fichier multimédia cible révisé et des mises à jour exactes de référence "
"aprèsle contenu sans mutation de WordPress."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:1000
msgid "Build Media Derivative Batch Plan"
msgstr "Créer un plan par lots dérivé des médias"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:1001
msgid ""
"Builds a bounded read-only plan for batch Cloud media derivative previews "
"from local media filters without calling Cloud, creating proposals, or "
"mutating WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Crée un plan limité en lecture seule pour les aperçus dérivés de médias "
"Cloud par lots à partir de filtres multimédias locaux sans appeler Cloud, "
"créer des propositions ou muter WordPress."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:27
msgid "WordPress Diagnostics Summary"
msgstr "WordPress Résumé des diagnostics"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:28
msgid ""
"Returns a redacted local WordPress diagnostics summary without Npcink AI, "
"MCP, filesystem path, database name, or secret details."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie un résumé des diagnostics locaux WordPress rédigés sans Npcink AI, "
"MCP, chemin du système de fichiers, nom de la base de données ou détails "
"secrets."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:76
msgid "WordPress Operations Diagnostics Detail"
msgstr "WordPress Détails des diagnostics des opérations"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:77
msgid ""
"Returns bounded local WordPress operations diagnostics with plugin, caller "
"capability, PHP, cache, rewrite, HTTPS, server, database, cron, structured "
"log, content type, role, widget, block-theme, search, integration, SEO, "
"security, and performance details."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie les diagnostics des opérations WordPress locales limitées avec le "
"plug-in, la capacité de l'appelant, PHP, le cache, la réécriture, HTTPS, le "
"serveur, la base de données, le cron, le journal structuré, le type de "
"contenu, le rôle, le widget, le thème de bloc, la recherche, l'intégration, "
"SEO, la sécurité et les détails des performances."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Audio_Read_Methods.php:31
msgid "A post_id is required before preparing article audio adoption."
msgstr ""
"Un post_id est requis avant de préparer l’adoption audio de l’article."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Audio_Read_Methods.php:34
msgid "An audio URL is required before preparing article audio adoption."
msgstr ""
"Une URL audio est requise avant de préparer l’adoption audio de l’article."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Audio_Read_Methods.php:89
msgid ""
"Attach the reviewed generated audio candidate to the current post after Core"
" approval."
msgstr ""
"Attacher le candidat audio généré examiné à la publication actuelle après "
"approbation de Core."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Audio_Read_Methods.php:142
msgid "Article audio adoption plan is ready for Core proposal intake."
msgstr ""
"Le plan d’adoption audio de l’article est prêt pour la réception de "
"proposition Core."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:27
msgid "You do not have permission to plan article drafts."
msgstr ""
"Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation de planifier des brouillons d’articles."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:38
msgid "Article block plans currently support post_type=post only."
msgstr ""
"Les plans de blocs d’article ne prennent actuellement en charge que "
"post_type=post."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:41
msgid "Article block plans currently support status=draft only."
msgstr ""
"Les plans de blocs d’article ne prennent actuellement en charge que "
"status=draft."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:44
msgid "Article template is not supported."
msgstr "Le modèle d’article n’est pas pris en charge."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:47
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Page_Pattern_Read_Methods.php:53
msgid "Responsive profile is not supported."
msgstr "Le profil responsive n’est pas pris en charge."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:50
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Page_Pattern_Read_Methods.php:59
msgid "Media strategy is not supported."
msgstr "La stratégie média n’est pas prise en charge."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:56
msgid "Target post was not found."
msgstr "La publication cible n’a pas été trouvée."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:59
msgid "You do not have permission to update the target post."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation de mettre à jour la publication cible."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:62
msgid "Target post must be a post."
msgstr "Le contenu cible doit être une publication."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:65
msgid "Target post must be a draft."
msgstr "La publication cible doit être un brouillon."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:108
msgid ""
"Replace the existing draft post body with reviewed Gutenberg-native "
"editorial blocks."
msgstr ""
"Remplacer le corps du brouillon de publication existant par des blocs "
"éditoriaux natifs Gutenberg examinés."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:129
msgid "Create a draft post before applying reviewed Gutenberg article blocks."
msgstr ""
"Créer un brouillon de publication avant d’appliquer les blocs d’article "
"Gutenberg examinés."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Block_Plan_Read_Methods.php:142
msgid ""
"Replace the draft post body with reviewed Gutenberg-native editorial blocks."
msgstr ""
"Remplacer le corps du brouillon de publication par des blocs éditoriaux "
"natifs Gutenberg examinés."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:184
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Content_Refresh_SEO_Read_Methods.php:28
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Content_Refresh_SEO_Read_Methods.php:531
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Post_Primitives_Read_Methods.php:533
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Post_Primitives_Read_Methods.php:678
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Publishing_Workflow_Read_Methods.php:28
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Publishing_Workflow_Read_Methods.php:336
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Publishing_Workflow_Read_Methods.php:446
msgid "post_id is invalid."
msgstr "post_id n'est pas valide."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:192
msgid "You are not allowed to read this post."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas autorisé à lire ce message."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:592
msgid ""
"Apply the reviewed article optimization excerpt through host governance."
msgstr ""
"Appliquer l’extrait d’optimisation d’article examiné via la gouvernance de "
"l’hôte."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:668
msgid "A post_id is required to build a content metadata apply plan."
msgstr ""
"Un post_id est requis pour construire un plan d’application des métadonnées "
"de contenu."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:677
msgid "The requested post was not found."
msgstr "La publication demandée n’a pas été trouvée."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:700
msgid ""
"At least one reviewed excerpt, category id, or tag id is required to build a"
" content metadata apply plan."
msgstr ""
"Au moins un extrait, un ID de catégorie ou un ID de balise examiné est "
"requis pour construire un plan d’application des métadonnées de contenu."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:757
msgid "Apply the reviewed excerpt through Core-governed update-post."
msgstr "Appliquer l’extrait examiné via update-post gouverné par Core."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:781
msgid ""
"Assign reviewed existing categories through Core-governed set-post-terms; "
"this planner does not create or assign terms directly."
msgstr ""
"Assigner les catégories existantes examinées via set-post-terms gouverné par"
" Core ; ce planificateur ne crée ni n’assigne de termes directement."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:805
msgid ""
"Assign reviewed existing tags through Core-governed set-post-terms; this "
"planner does not create or assign terms directly."
msgstr ""
"Assigner les balises existantes examinées via set-post-terms gouverné par "
"Core ; ce planificateur ne crée ni n’assigne de termes directement."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:815
msgid ""
"Proposed new terms are preserved as vocabulary-gap review notes only. This "
"plan never creates missing taxonomy terms."
msgstr ""
"Les nouveaux termes proposés sont conservés uniquement comme notes d’examen "
"sur les lacunes de vocabulaire. Ce plan ne crée jamais de termes de "
"taxonomie manquants."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Optimization_Read_Methods.php:934
msgid "One or more selected taxonomy terms were not found."
msgstr ""
"Un ou plusieurs termes de taxonomie sélectionnés n’ont pas été trouvés."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Production_Read_Methods.php:49
msgid ""
"Template style risk is high; review and polish the article before scheduling"
" or publishing."
msgstr ""
"Le risque lié au style de modèle est élevé ; révisez et peaufinez l’article "
"avant de le planifier ou de le publier."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Production_Read_Methods.php:52
msgid "Quality review requires human review before scheduling or publishing."
msgstr ""
"L'examen de la qualité nécessite un examen humain avant la planification ou "
"lapublication."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Article_Production_Read_Methods.php:58
msgid ""
"A duplicate production candidate was detected; review before scheduling or "
"publishing."
msgstr ""
"Un candidat à la production en double a été détecté ; examiner avant de "
"planifier ou de publier."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:28
msgid "You do not have permission to read block theme context."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation de lire le contexte du thème de blocs."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:78
msgid "You do not have permission to inspect block theme surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation d’inspecter les surfaces de thèmes de blocs."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:81
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:200
#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:446
msgid "The active theme is not reported as a block theme."
msgstr "Le thème actif n’est pas signalé comme thème de blocs."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:189
msgid "You do not have permission to plan block theme changes."
msgstr ""
"Vous n’avez pas l’autorisation de planifier des modifications de thème de "
"blocs."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:197
msgid ""
"Block theme site plans currently support intent=add_breadcrumbs or "
"intent=customize_template_layout only."
msgstr ""
"Les plans de site de thème de blocs ne prennent actuellement en charge que "
"intent=add_breadcrumbs ou intent=customize_template_layout."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:325
msgid ""
"Update one existing Site Editor template with reviewed breadcrumb blocks "
"after Core approval."
msgstr ""
"Mettre à jour un modèle existant de l’Éditeur du site avec des blocs de fil "
"d’Ariane examinés après approbation de Core."

#: includes/Packages/Read_Traits/Block_Theme_Read_Methods.php:326
msgid ""
"Create a reviewed Site Editor template override from the active theme file "
"template after Core approval."
